# Local environment variables (never commit real credentials).
#
# NOTE: The Resend email integration was removed from this project, so there is
# no RESEND_API_KEY to configure — and the unused Gmail SMTP credentials
# (MAIL_SERVER / MAIL_PORT / MAIL_USE_TLS / MAIL_USERNAME / MAIL_*)
# were deleted from this file as well.
#
# The only variables app.py still reads, both OPTIONAL (safe defaults apply when
# they are absent), are:
#   FLASK_SECRET_KEY            - Flask session signing key
#   SITE_URL / PUBLIC_BASE_URL  - public base URL used to build absolute links